// `float`'s (dec128 is base-10, so every digit survives to the nanosecond):
//
// ```go
// decimal("1704067200.123456789").time()    // => time("2024-01-01T00:00:00.123456789Z")
// ```
//
//kavun:member time pure ([default]) -> time
